                                "sense_id": "9c8389a2-e110-30de-a1e6-8f5be0ad0fe6",
                                "text": "'And am I to plunge a harpoon into that beast!' 'That's your privilege, my son,' said Malone, 'and, sad to relate, unless I give it a miss in baulk, I shall have to be at your side when you do it.'"
